# sacrifice. Turn 4 Bot2 bolts itself for 3 and Bot1 draws nothing. Turn 5 Bot2 gains 3 with Lightning Helix (still nothing
# drawn: a gain is not a loss), then the Ruler's attack takes 5 and draws 5.

